**/node_modules
**/dist
**/data
.git
.github
docs
screenshots
assets
*.md
# CHANGELOG.md ships INSIDE the image (the account menu's "What's new" reads it), so the
# blanket *.md above must not swallow it — an image built without it shows an empty panel.
!CHANGELOG.md
# Never let a developer's local secrets into the build context. `COPY server/ ./` and
# `COPY web/ ./` would otherwise bake a local .env into an image layer, where it survives
# even if a later step deletes the file.
.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
